# Search tools that read this file (ripgrep, and agents built on it) skip these paths. They hold the text of held-out
# confirmatory items (Study 002's P-CONF, Study 001's confirmatory side). A repository-wide search once showed a preview
# of one (reports/ERRATA.md §44, later line of 2026-11-13). git grep and plain grep do not read this file: scope those by
# hand. To read one of these files on purpose, name it directly.
release/**/frozen_prompts_*
results/**/frozen_prompts_*
results/**/*confirmatory*
reports/study-002/pconf-v1/*.jsonl
